---
<Base title="ro-mono-303 user guide · Lemus" description="How to use ro-mono-303: the ROM and voice mode, panel artwork, writing and playing patterns and tracks on the TB-303's own sequencer, the plugin bars, SERVICE and the trimmers, MIDI and DAW sync." current="ro-mono-303">

<div class="sheet">
<div class="col guide">

